6f1011468921cf5042c134c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5ed0aa8c/uploads/origins/6ca28eb3-ac65-44a0-b3b6-67cc3defb389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eefe8547f6f1011468921cf5042c134c, https://si.imgix.net/5ed0aa8c/uploads/origins/6ca28eb3-ac65-44a0-b3b6-67cc3defb389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=94073b61695bb8e9ec652e7bc5dddbbc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5ed0aa8c/uploads/origins/6ca28eb3-ac65-44a0-b3b6-67cc3defb389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7c98a112b4345e3b3a737ffb58d865c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "先生、また来ました。今回は前回触られたOCに恥ずかしそうな、もしくはツンデレな表情をさせたいです。首には首輪をつけています。あとは自由に描いてください！こちらが私のOCのリンクです：https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LFf7k06KUrHEuiq5O_go2otPzHTDKc1Q", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hetakitsune/works/43", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2679a57a/uploads/origins/5dddecef-a9f2-4faa-b84f-27f2bf110905?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c4f771719551f6c5ec8eac7bbd73a4c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2679a57a/uploads/origins/5dddecef-a9f2-4faa-b84f-27f2bf110905?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c4f771719551f6c5ec8eac7bbd73a4c, https://si.imgix.net/2679a57a/uploads/origins/5dddecef-a9f2-4faa-b84f-27f2bf110905?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=448d5cd0d1d00b44ec04b5012048b218 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2679a57a/uploads/origins/5dddecef-a9f2-4faa-b84f-27f2bf110905?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=12ec29641891c7b5089ef79afa231c9b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの作品、本当に大好きです！！すごく可愛いです！！私のキャラクターをあなたのスタイルで描いていただけませんか？彼はオオカミです！ポーズは自由に決めてください！本当にありがとうございます！https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wJuDz3i0wjkChEu4XhohT50Jv88aG_kC/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hetakitsune/works/42", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/368dcb7a/uploads/origins/38102aee-43d7-492c-a741-6973dfde44ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4757c8c0f3e13f0793192b9dbf6f750", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/368dcb7a/uploads/origins/38102aee-43d7-492c-a741-6973dfde44ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4757c8c0f3e13f0793192b9dbf6f750, https://si.imgix.net/368dcb7a/uploads/origins/38102aee-43d7-492c-a741-6973dfde44ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a8110404178422fa3ca1e73c7e001c3e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/368dcb7a/uploads/origins/38102aee-43d7-492c-a741-6973dfde44ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5df43a0f596d17d58a13c03cc1cf2b6f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again! The way you draw my character is always so cute! I would love to have you draw them again! \n\nPlease draw freely! Feel free to use the outfits in the gallery!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/skeb-references-ytTauJq", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hetakitsune/works/41", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/134d13d8/uploads/origins/f4601471-6858-4ebe-b158-754526e60ac1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76f81d895428a08a69a4ebb9b3a064bf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/134d13d8/uploads/origins/f4601471-6858-4ebe-b158-754526e60ac1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76f81d895428a08a69a4ebb9b3a064bf, https://si.imgix.net/134d13d8/uploads/origins/f4601471-6858-4ebe-b158-754526e60ac1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2585e3b17910ef7995fcfc34450769a2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/134d13d8/uploads/origins/f4601471-6858-4ebe-b158-754526e60ac1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=632224f6e0e2a78a593fb671e6c1793c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、先生！僕のOCはシーフードのシャチドラゴンなんだけど、水の要素が欲しいんだ！私のOCへのリンクはこちら：https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LFf7k06KUrHEuiq5O_go2otPzHTDKc1Q", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hetakitsune/works/40", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/20ffa902/uploads/origins/47c461a5-88f2-44a9-a136-e5aa80eb21ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8d8d991ab63514882f9326ca69578e47", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/20ffa902/uploads/origins/47c461a5-88f2-44a9-a136-e5aa80eb21ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8d8d991ab63514882f9326ca69578e47, https://si.imgix.net/20ffa902/uploads/origins/47c461a5-88f2-44a9-a136-e5aa80eb21ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4b598d47d29316c7afa95a4d5a268b0d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/20ffa902/uploads/origins/47c461a5-88f2-44a9-a136-e5aa80eb21ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f0c62b6c477c0fc0616c0d2b747f0920 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私のファーソナを描いていただけませんか？\nオス猫で、両頬に2-3本のひげが生えています。左右対称になるようにお願いします。\n女性らしいセーラー服を着て、少し恥ずかしそうな表情をしてほしいです。\n青い左手と左目が見えるようにお願いします。\nショールは描かなくていいです。\nポーズや構図はお任せします。\nありがとうございました！\n\n私のファーソナ\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hHPWuPQ4HpueFNEEVPJTTbu8Y3dJjiwu?usp=drive_link\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hHPWuPQ4HpueFNEEVPJTTbu8Y3dJjiwu?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hetakitsune/works/39", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2f33dcfe/uploads/origins/d11515f7-d258-4b9e-8b24-65e8b3679a8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f2aa180dda961870b6ee243f7713130", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2f33dcfe/uploads/origins/d11515f7-d258-4b9e-8b24-65e8b3679a8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f2aa180dda961870b6ee243f7713130, https://si.imgix.net/2f33dcfe/uploads/origins/d11515f7-d258-4b9e-8b24-65e8b3679a8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a32fb9079c1aec911b934a7335f6a45c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2f33dcfe/uploads/origins/d11515f7-d258-4b9e-8b24-65e8b3679a8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2aa6e04f3bcfc5920d35abb35ff72c51 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！  私の着ぐるみキャラを描いていただけますか？ \nポーズやシチュエーションはおまかせでお願いします\nでは、よろしくお願いします！  \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1D229rl-qxb2EatiNRl4xxem3nxpolA6v?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hetakitsune/works/38", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7babd447/uploads/origins/569fb03b-b676-42d0-856e-d1c23fcc9dec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=53a3ff27a44af2b6d7d77b56c127bedb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7babd447/uploads/origins/569fb03b-b676-42d0-856e-d1c23fcc9dec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=53a3ff27a44af2b6d7d77b56c127bedb, https://si.imgix.net/7babd447/uploads/origins/569fb03b-b676-42d0-856e-d1c23fcc9dec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e685ee3986644b6c37aeeb5932223af8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7babd447/uploads/origins/569fb03b-b676-42d0-856e-d1c23fcc9dec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3d329a6bb5fcf30b5942ff29d8e58afc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again! I'd love for you to draw my cat again!\n\nCould you draw them in a pose like this? Feel free to use any outfits (or none of them) you see in the gallery! \n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/NcUvVk9\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/shawacatskebrefs-EruJKe5", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hetakitsune/works/37", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b04ec6b7/uploads/origins/5f31fe67-1745-4d9b-bad0-35f987a5b718?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=20